## Conventions

- Stability label at the top of every doc: `Stability: stable | evolving | draft`.
- Documentation language: **${PROJECT_LANGUAGE}**. Code identifiers: English.
- Architecture decisions → ADRs in `architecture/decisions/NNNN-title.md`.
- Update this index when adding a top-level doc under `docs/`.

